WEBVTT

00:01:57.757 --> 00:02:00.693
the judge set Titus free.

00:02:00.693 --> 00:02:04.724
And really, that's where this case should have ended.

00:02:04.724 --> 00:02:05.847
It should have been over.

00:02:05.847 --> 00:02:08.367
Titus should have thought of this as a horrible year,

00:02:08.367 --> 00:02:12.203
a year of accusation and trial, but over.

00:02:12.203 --> 00:02:14.250
It didn't end that way.

00:02:14.250 --> 00:02:16.928
Titus was so bitter.

00:02:16.928 --> 00:02:19.508
He'd lost his job. He couldn't get it back.

00:02:19.508 --> 00:02:21.351
He lost his fiancée.

00:02:21.351 --> 00:02:24.257
She couldn't put up with his persistent anger.

00:02:24.257 --> 00:02:26.403
He lost his entire savings,

00:02:26.403 --> 00:02:29.261
and so he decided to file a lawsuit

00:02:29.261 --> 00:02:31.542
against the police and others whom he felt